    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that but it doesnt feel like that. it feels like there is no way back. once you've lost everything and everyone looks at you like you're some kind of cautionary tale... how do you even walk down the street? it's like i'm already dead to them, i just have to keep walking through the motions of this disaster until it's officially over. it's just so much more dignity to just... stop the descent before it gets even more pathetic.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
